CombinoGen :
------------

- install pyhton 2.7 dev :
	$> sudo apt-get install python-dev
- install pip
	$> sudo apt-get install python-pip
- install pyside
	$> pip install setuptools
	$> sudo apt-get install qt4-*
	$> sudo apt-get install pyside-tools 
	$> pip install pyside
- install cython
	$> sudo apt-get install cython
- install qt4*
	$> sudo apt-get install qt4-*
 install pyExcelerator 
	$> sudo apt-get install python-excelerator 
	$> sudo apt-get install python-xlwt
	$> sudo apt-get install python-xlrd
- get WinaScan, and put it at the same level as CombinoGen
- get Selenium :
	$> pip install selenium
- get xvfb :
	$> sudo apt-get install xvfb
	$> pip install setuptools
	$> pip install --user pyvirtualdisplay==1.3.2
 	$> rm  -rf /home/poupou/.local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/EasyProcess-1.1.dist-info/
 	$> rm -rf /home/poupou/.local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/easyprocess/
 	$> pip install --user easyprocess==0.3

- get geckodriver :
	put it in a local directory, and update CombinoGUI.sh : export PATH=...	
- get splinter :
	$> sudo pip install splinter

